{"agent":"fix-complete-gates","data":{"item":"B-fix-stale-after-merge","summary":"tree_fingerprint never reports 'clean': it joins three parts with NUL and tests body.strip(), which does not strip NUL, so a clean tree gets the digest of '\\0\\0' (95e0c70caf8cc336) instead of 'clean'. Every recorded tree_sha therefore reads as dirty, and nothing can tell from the evidence that a gate ran on a committed tree. Probe: clean worktree, status/diff/untracked all empty -> tree_fingerprint = '<head>+95e0c70caf8cc336'."},"id":"eaee63985419e6854288997f4","kind":"bug.found","lamport":6065,"schema":1,"subject":"B-fingerprint-never-clean","ts":"2026-10-01T18:53:48.348319Z"}
